[{"source" ":org/Math-Academy" "forms" [{:db/id 17592186345055 :question/problem "Let $R=[1,3]\\times [0,2]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=x+y-1.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{1,2,3\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{0,1,2\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCalculate the lower Riemann sum $L(f,P).$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186152149 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-a55a479e-4a45-5971-8018-f156cd1ee741"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-a55a479e-4a45-5971-8018-f156cd1ee741" :question/id #uuid "a55a479e-4a45-5971-8018-f156cd1ee741" :question/math-academy-id "q-75252" :question/problem "Let $R=[0,4]\\times [1,5]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=9-x-y.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{0,2,4\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{1,3,5\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCalculate the lower Riemann sum $L(f,P).$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's draw the region $R$ and the partition $P.$\n\n![](images/97/97220aa0d23d01e807608e6194a37661ba77cc391d0adf537908c1f13b1b6de8.png)\n\nThe lower Riemann sum $L(f,P)$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={m}_{11}\\cdot \\text{Area}({R}_{11})+{m}_{21}\\cdot \\text{Area}({R}_{21})+{m}_{12}\\cdot \\text{Area}({R}_{12})+{m}_{22}\\cdot \\text{Area}({R}_{22})\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the minimum value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ We pick the *minimum* value of $f$ because we're finding the *lower* sum.\n\nTaking into account the fact that $\\text{Area}({R}_{ij})=4$ for all $4$ subregions, the formula for $L(f,P)$ reduces to\n\n$$\nL(f,P)=4{m}_{11}+4{m}_{21}+4{m}_{12}+4{m}_{22}.\n$$\n\nNow, notice that\n\n- $f(x,y)=9-x-y$ decreases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=9-x-y$ decreases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/30/306666a0e69fca9dc47c2295aa616a944482f00b28fdd96d9d96af816b058447.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion.\n\n![](images/15/15512c5f5063309474534a54b323d87c28cf9b776c10789a8f70e12cdb898aeb.png)\n\nHence:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{11} & =f(2,3)=4 \\\\ {m}_{21} & =f(4,3)=2 \\\\ {m}_{12} & =f(2,5)=2 \\\\ {m}_{22} & =f(4,5)=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nL(f,P)=4\\cdot 4+4\\cdot 2+4\\cdot 2+4\\cdot 0=32.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e7df747d-5ae6-580b-89b5-66c235ad174c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e7df747d-5ae6-580b-89b5-66c235ad174c" :answer-field/id #uuid "e7df747d-5ae6-580b-89b5-66c235ad174c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-258f88c7-c0a2-56e8-9230-059a60c0a8e3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ec56fda9-5a7a-576c-a3c2-f64506f5aa01" "answer-858f5818-4647-5518-b75d-f2e9dd90e7f8" "answer-258f88c7-c0a2-56e8-9230-059a60c0a8e3" "answer-b17bf7f2-0d3c-57ff-a579-7f0faaabe3b9" "answer-98578764-7601-57dc-9d67-e947a3ce724a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ec56fda9-5a7a-576c-a3c2-f64506f5aa01" :answer/id #uuid "ec56fda9-5a7a-576c-a3c2-f64506f5aa01" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-858f5818-4647-5518-b75d-f2e9dd90e7f8" :answer/id #uuid "858f5818-4647-5518-b75d-f2e9dd90e7f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-258f88c7-c0a2-56e8-9230-059a60c0a8e3" :answer/id #uuid "258f88c7-c0a2-56e8-9230-059a60c0a8e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b17bf7f2-0d3c-57ff-a579-7f0faaabe3b9" :answer/id #uuid "b17bf7f2-0d3c-57ff-a579-7f0faaabe3b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-98578764-7601-57dc-9d67-e947a3ce724a" :answer/id #uuid "985